.IX Title "Lucy::Search::PolySearcher 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::PolySearcher 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Search::PolySearcher \- Aggregate results from multiple Searchers.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 9
\&    my $schema = MySchema\->new;
\&    for my $index (@index_paths) {
\&        push @searchers, Lucy::Search::IndexSearcher\->new( index => $index );
\&    }
\&    my $poly_searcher = Lucy::Search::PolySearcher\->new(
\&        schema    => $schema,
\&        searchers => \e@searchers,
\&    );
\&    my $hits = $poly_searcher\->hits( query => $query );
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
The primary use for PolySearcher is to aggregate results from several
indexes on a single machine.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.IX Header "CONSTRUCTORS"
.SS new
.IX Subsection "new"
.Vb 4
\&    my $poly_searcher = Lucy::Search::PolySearcher\->new(
\&        schema    => $schema,
\&        searchers => \e@searchers,
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Create a new PolySearcher.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBschema\fR \- A Schema.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBsearchers\fR \- An array of Searchers.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS get_searchers
.IX Subsection "get_searchers"
.Vb 1
\&    my $arrayref = $poly_searcher\->get_searchers();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for searchers.
.SS doc_max
.IX Subsection "doc_max"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $poly_searcher\->doc_max();
.Ve
.PP
Return the maximum number of docs in the collection represented by the
Searcher, which is also the highest possible internal doc id.
Documents which have been marked as deleted but not yet purged are
included in this count.
.SS doc_freq
.IX Subsection "doc_freq"
.Vb 4
\&    my $int = $poly_searcher\->doc_freq(
\&        field => $field,  # required
\&        term  => $term,   # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Return the number of documents which contain the term in the given
field.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBfield\fR \- Field name.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBterm\fR \- The term to look up.
.SS collect
.IX Subsection "collect"
.Vb 4
\&    $poly_searcher\->collect(
\&        query     => $query,      # required
\&        collector => $collector,  # required
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Iterate over hits, feeding them into a
Collector.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBquery\fR \- A Query.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBcollector\fR \- A Collector.
.SS fetch_doc
.IX Subsection "fetch_doc"
.Vb 1
\&    my $hit_doc = $poly_searcher\->fetch_doc($doc_id);
.Ve
.PP
Retrieve a document.  Throws an error if the doc id is out of range.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBdoc_id\fR \- A document id.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Search::PolySearcher isa Lucy::Search::Searcher isa Clownfish::Obj.
